WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.206
The dusty stranger bowed to Rat.

2
00:00:19.207 --> 00:00:22.339
Then he smiled and sat down.

3
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.072
Rat sat down too.

4
00:00:25.073 --> 00:00:28.415
The stranger took a deep breath.

5
00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:32.494
"I smell clover and smoke on the wind.

6
00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:37.804
A river runs close by here," he said, sniffing.

7
00:00:37.805 --> 00:00:40.953
"You have a good life, my friend."

8
00:00:40.954 --> 00:00:43.804
"Yes," said Rat proudly.

9
00:00:43.805 --> 00:00:46.820
"The riverbank is the best!"

10
00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:50.210
The visitor smiled to himself.

11
00:00:50.211 --> 00:00:54.600
"Well, it's not for everyone," he said.

12
00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:57.457
"Where are you from?" asked Rat.

13
00:00:57.458 --> 00:01:01.801
"I am a sea rat," he said.

14
00:01:01.802 --> 00:01:06.898
"I was born in an old city far away."

15
00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:10.339
"A sea rat?" asked Rat.

16
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.079
"Yes," said Sea Rat.

17
00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.816
"I know every port in the world."

18
00:01:16.817 --> 00:01:20.016
"You sail on big ships!" said Rat.

19
00:01:20.017 --> 00:01:25.684
Rat loved all boats, big and small.

20
00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:29.681
"Tell me all about it!" said Rat.

21
00:01:29.682 --> 00:01:35.205
"Once I sailed the coast of Italy," said Sea Rat.

22
00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:39.218
"I lived in the captain's cabin."

23
00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:43.201
Sea Rat sighed with pleasure.

24
00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:46.404
"We ate shellfish with wine!

25
00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:50.439
We dined on baked bread and cheese.

26
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:55.210
On shore, we lay under olive trees."

27
00:01:55.211 --> 00:01:59.612
Rat imagined all the food.

28
00:01:59.613 --> 00:02:03.602
"Now I'm hungry," said Rat.

29
00:02:03.603 --> 00:02:05.888
"Will you have lunch with me?"

30
00:02:05.889 --> 00:02:11.857
"A wonderful idea!" said Sea Rat.
